  "post_content": "<p>La sala Stravaganza de Onda ha sido esta madrugada escenario para el desfile de Lencer&iacute;a Atzavara, con conjuntos apropiados para las pr&oacute;ximas fiestas.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2011/12/IMG_4113.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Tres chicos y tres chicas han mostrado la mejor selecci&oacute;n de las prendas de la tienda ondense que dirigen Pilar Romero y Marta Gaya.</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfilelenceria/img_4073.jpg\" alt=\"img_4073\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfilelenceria/img_4074.jpg\" alt=\"img_4074\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfilelenceria/img_4075.jpg\" alt=\"img_4075\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfilelenceria/img_4076.jpg\" alt=\"img_4076\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfilelenceria/img_4077.jpg\" alt=\"img_4077\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfilelenceria/img_4078.jpg\" alt=\"img_4078\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfilelenceria/img_4079.jpg\" alt=\"img_4079\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfilelenceria/img_4080.jpg\" alt=\"img_4080\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfilelenceria/img_4081.jpg\" alt=\"img_4081\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfilelenceria/img_40